msgstr "FAQ"

#: index.php:279 index.php:486
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Izvorni kod"

#: index.php:312
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus je alat koji pomaže u formatiranju i pravljenju bootable USB fleš "
"diskova, kao što su USB ključevi/pendrajvovi, memorijski stikovi, itd."

#: index.php:313
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Posebno može biti koristan u sledećim slučajevima:"

#: index.php:315
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"želite napraviti USB instalacione medije iz bootable ISO slika (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, itd.)"

#: index.php:316
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "morate raditi na sistemu koji nema instaliran OS"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "želite da flešujete BIOS ili drugi firmver iz DOS-a"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "želite pokrenuti neki low-level alat"

#: index.php:320
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Uprkos svojoj maloj veličini, Rufus obezbeđuje sve što vam je potrebno!"

#: index.php:321
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom "
"of this page."
msgstr "Spisak ISO slika koje Rufus podržava se nalazi na dnu stranice."

#: index.php:328
