msgid "System Requirements:"
msgstr "Sistemski zahtevi:"

#: index.php:378
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 ili noviji."

#: index.php:378
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Kada se preuzme, aplikacija je spremna za upotrebu."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Podržani jezici:"

#: index.php:425
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Ja ću iskoristiti ovu priliku da izrazim svoju zahvalnost prema prevodiocima "
"koji su omogućili da Rufus, kao i ova stranica, budu prevedeni na različite "
"jezike. Ako vidite da Rufus može da koristi vaš jezik, zahvalite im se!"

#: index.php:429
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Preuzmite izvršnu datoteku i pokrenite je &ndash; instalacija nije potrebna."

#: index.php:430
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr "Izvršna datoteka je digitalno potpisana i potpis bi trebao da glasi:"

#: index.php:432
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 ili novije)"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 ili novije)"

#: index.php:435
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Napomene o DOS podršci:"

#: index.php:436
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Ako pravite DOS bootable diskove i ne koristite US tastaturu, Rufus će "
"probati da odabere raspored tastature na osnovu vašeg sistema."

#: index.php:437
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Napomene o ISO podršci:"

#: index.php:438
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from "
"an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Sve verzije Rufus-a posle v1.1.0 podržavaju pravljenje bootable USB-a sa <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO slike</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the "
"freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pravljenje ISO slike sa fizičkog diska ili seta fajlova je veoma lako, "
"međutim potrebno je koristiti aplikaciju za rezanje CD-a, npr. slobodno "
"dostupna <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> ili <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

#: index.php:442
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Često Postavljana Pitanja (FAQ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:443
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr ""
"Rufus FAQ je dostupan <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>OVDE</a></b> (na engleskom)."

#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Da obezbedite povratne informacije, prijavite grešku ili zatražite "
"poboljšanje, molimo vas koristite GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue</a>. "
"Ili možete <a target=\"_blank\" %s>poslati e-mail</a>."

#: index.php:447
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licenca"

#: index.php:448
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU Generalna Javna Licenca (GPL) verzija 3</a> ili "
"novija."

#: index.php:448
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you "
"respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Slobodni ste deliti, modifikovati, pa čak i prodavati program, sve dok "
"poštujete GPLv3 licencu."

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Rufus se proizvodi u 100%% transparentnom maniru na osnovu <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>javnog izvornog koda</a>, koristeći <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> okruženje."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:452
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Lista izmena (na engleskom)"

#: index.php:488
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, možete klonirati <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repozitorijum "
"pomoću:"

#: index.php:490
#, php-format
msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija, pogledajte naš <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub projekat</"
"a>."

#: index.php:491
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste developer, ohrabrujemo vas da poboljšate Rufus i predložite zakrpe."

#: index.php:494
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Donacije"

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Pošto me često pitaju o ovome, <b>ne postoji</b> dugme za donaciju na ovoj "
"stranici."

#: index.php:496
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Glavni razlog je zato što mislim da sistem donacija zapravo ne pomaže "
"razvijanju programa i još gore, može biti izazvati osećaj krivice za "
"korisnike koji odluče da ne doniraju."

#: index.php:499
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Ako zaista insistirate, uvek možete donirati <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>Zadužbini Besplatnih Programa</a>, jer su oni glavni razlog zbog čega su "
"programi poput Rufus-a mogući."

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much "
"appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"U svakom slučaju, ja ću iskoristiti ovu priliku da kažem <i><u>hvala vam</"
"u></i> za stalnu podršku i entuzijazam oko ovog malog programa. To veoma "
"cenim!"

#: index.php:501
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Ali, molim vas budite slobodni da koristite Rufus bez ikakve krivice zbog "
"toga što mu niste doprineli finansijski &ndash; nikada to ne morate uraditi!"

#: index.php:504
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Spisak ISO slika sa kojima je dokazano da Rufus radi"

